.Dd August 2026
.Dt XPT.MANIFEST 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm xpt.manifest
.Nd package metadata file format
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a key=value text file embedded in an
.Xr xpt 8
package, describing its metadata.
It is generated by
.Xr ebs 1
from an
.Xr ebs 5
formula.
.Pp
each line has the form
.Ar key Ns = Ns Ar value .
blank lines are ignored.
lines beginning with
.Sq //
are treated as comments and ignored.
unknown keys are ignored with a warning.
.Pp
the following keys are required
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va name
name of the package.
.It Va version
version of the package.
.It Va desc
short description of the package.
.It Va maintainer
maintainer of the formula.
.It Va arch
architecture the package was built for.
.El
.Pp
the following keys are optional:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Va depends
comma-separated list of runtime package dependencies
.It Va license
a SPDX-compatible license string.
.It Va homepage
a URL to the package's website.
.It Va build_epoch
unix timestamp of when the package was built.
.It Va provides
comma-separated list of provided virtual packages.
if another package already provides a listed capability,
.Xr xpt 8
will prompt to replace it.
.It Va triggers
comma-separated list of post-install triggers to run.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr mkfhs 1 ,
.Xr ebs 5 ,
.Xr ecw 8 ,
.Xr rig 1 ,
.Xr libxpt 3 ,
